sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Emp as Employee
  participant Q as Review queue
  participant API as API route
  participant DB as Application DB
  participant AI as Scoring service
  Emp->>Q: Open pending request
  Q->>API: Request detail
  API->>DB: Load request
  DB-->>API: Request data
  API->>AI: Analyze rubric
  AI-->>API: Five rubric dimensions
  API-->>Emp: Rubric + recommendation
  Emp->>API: Accept or reject
  API->>DB: Accept: create partner + history
  API->>DB: Reject: update request + reason
  API-->>Emp: Applicant email sent
